# Unanchored, deliberately: the anchored "/target" this replaces did NOT cover ffi/target, and a
# plain  would therefore have staged ffi/target/release/libkdu_facade.so — a binary
# that statically links Kakadu, i.e. an "Application" under clause 13.1(b) of the Kakadu licence.
# That must never be committed, published, or made available to an AI tool.
target/
/.cache/
*.obj

compile_commands.json
compile_commands.events.json

lcov.info